msgid "1-MP global-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr "1-MP global-shutter kolor + FLIR Lepton termalni na jednom modulu."

msgid "1.8–5.5V battery input via a DC barrel jack."
msgstr "Ulaz baterije 1,8–5,5V putem DC barrel priključka."

msgid "10 Mb/s differential serial for industrial buses."
msgstr "10 Mb/s diferencijalna serijska veza za industrijske sabirnice."

msgid "10/100 Ethernet with Power-over-Ethernet."
msgstr "10/100 Ethernet s napajanjem putem Etherneta."

msgid "2.3\" SPI LCD with capacitive multi-touch and Qwiic."
msgstr "2,3\" SPI LCD s kapacitivnim višestrukim dodirom i Qwiic."

msgid "5MP HDR sensor — high dynamic range for tough lighting."
msgstr ""
"5MP HDR senzor — visoki dinamički raspon za teške uvjete osvjetljenja."

msgid "5MP rolling-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr "5MP rolling-shutter kolor + FLIR Lepton termalni na jednom modulu."

msgid "6µA standby motion trigger plus white and 850 nm IR."
msgstr "6µA standby okidač pokreta plus bijela i 850 nm IR."

msgid "8 Mb/s CAN-FD plus 1 Mb/s RS-232 in one shield."
msgstr "8 Mb/s CAN-FD plus 1 Mb/s RS-232 u jednom štitu."

msgid ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> returns connected pixel regions matching one or more"
" LAB thresholds."
msgstr ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> vraća spojene regije piksela koje odgovaraju jednom "
"ili više LAB praga."

msgid ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> draws all 21 joints and connections in "
"one call."
msgstr ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> crta svih 21 zglob i veze u jednom "
"pozivu."

msgid ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> filters tiny detections; "
"<code>merge=True</code> joins overlapping blobs."
msgstr ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> filtrira male detekcije; "
"<code>merge=True</code> spaja preklapajuće nakupine."

msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API referenca"

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Boson / Boson+ — higher-resolution thermal."
msgstr "Adapter za FLIR Boson / Boson+ — toplinski prikaz veće rezolucije."

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermal cores."
msgstr "Adapter za FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x termalne jezgre."

msgid ""
"Add-on boards that plug into the OpenMV Cam — networking, motor control, "
"displays, and more."
msgstr ""
"Dodatne ploče koje se priključuju u OpenMV Cam — umrežavanje, upravljanje "
"motorima, zasloni i više."

msgid "Add-ons"
msgstr "Dodaci"

msgid "Alif Ensemble E3 — fusion-class Cortex-M55 with Ethos-U55 NPU."
msgstr "Alif Ensemble E3 — Cortex-M55 s Ethos-U55 NPU."

msgid "AprilTag tracking"
msgstr "AprilTag praćenje"

msgid ""
"AprilTags are 2D fiducial markers — robust to motion blur and partial "
"occlusion, and they give you full 3D pose."
msgstr ""
"AprilTag su 2D fiducijalni markeri — robusni na zamagljenje pokretom i "
"djelomično zaklanjanje, i daju punu 3D pozu."

msgid "Async Bluetooth Low Energy — peripherals, advertising, and GATT."
msgstr "Async Bluetooth Low Energy — periferni uređaji, oglašavanje i GATT."

msgid "Back to top"
msgstr "Na vrh"

msgid "Bar code detection"
msgstr "Otkrivanje barkoda"

msgid "BlazeFace tracking"
msgstr "BlazeFace praćenje"

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Ploče"

msgid ""
"Bring your own YOLOv8 model trained on <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> and load it the same way."
msgstr ""
"Donesite vlastiti YOLOv8 model treniran na <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> i učitajte ga na isti način."

msgid "Built-in detector — no model file or training needed."
msgstr "Ugrađeni detektor — nije potrebna datoteka modela ni treniranje."

msgid ""
"Camera control: pixel formats, frame sizes, exposure, gain, and white "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Upravljanje kamerom: formati piksela, veličine okvira, ekspozicija, "
"pojačanje i balans bjeline."

msgid "Camera modules"
msgstr "Moduli kamere"

msgid ""
"Camera modules and sensor adapters that plug into the board-to-board "
"connector — colour, monochrome, thermal, and event-based vision."
msgstr ""
"Moduli kamere i adapteri senzora koji se priključuju u konektor ploča-do-"
"ploče — kolor, monokromatski, toplinski i vizija temeljena na događajima."

msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Popis promjena"

msgid ""
"Click the socket-icon connect button in the IDE, then hit the green play "
"arrow to run your first script."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb za povezivanje s ikonom utičnice u IDE-u, zatim pritisnite "
"zelenu strelicu za reprodukciju kako biste pokrenuli svoju prvu skriptu."

msgid "Color tracking"
msgstr "Praćenje boje"

msgid "Community &amp; links"
msgstr "Zajednica &amp; poveznice"

msgid "Community discussion, help, and project sharing."
msgstr "Rasprava zajednice, pomoć i dijeljenje projekata."

msgid "Compact 23 × 23 mm STM32H747 board with on-board sensor."
msgstr "Kompaktna 23 × 23 mm STM32H747 ploča s ugrađenim senzorom."

msgid ""
"Compiler, runtime, native modules, and porting MicroPython to new MCUs."
msgstr ""
"Prevodilac, izvršavanje, nativni moduli i portiranje MicroPython-a na nove "
"MCU-e."

msgid "Connect your cam"
msgstr "Poveži svoju kameru"

msgid "Cooperative multitasking — run camera, network, and I/O in parallel."
msgstr ""
"Kooperativna višezadaćnost — paralelno pokretanje kamere, mreže i I/O."

msgid "Copy page"
msgstr "Kopiraj stranicu"

msgid "Core libraries"
msgstr "Temeljne biblioteke"

msgid "Detect faces with BlazeFace"
msgstr "Otkrijte lica s BlazeFace"

msgid "Differences from CPython"
msgstr "Razlike od CPython-a"

msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "Rasprava"

msgid ""
"Download and install OpenMV IDE for Windows, macOS, or Linux and launch the "
"IDE."
msgstr ""
"Preuzmite i instalirajte OpenMV IDE za Windows, macOS ili Linux i pokrenite "
"IDE."

msgid ""
"Drive up to 4 servos drawing up to 5A while powering the camera, 6–36V "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Pogon do 4 servo motora uz potrošnju do 5A uz napajanje kamere, ulaz 6–36V."

msgid "Each result also exposes version, ECC level, and corner coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Svaki rezultat također izlaže verziju, razinu ECC i koordinate kutova."

msgid ""
"Each result has format, payload, rotation, corners, and a bounding rect."
msgstr ""
"Svaki rezultat ima format, korisnu poruku, rotaciju, kutove i ograđujući "
"pravokutnik."

msgid "Edit this page"
msgstr "Uredi ovu stranicu"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Primjeri"

msgid "Explore by board"
msgstr "Istraži po ploči"

msgid "Explore →"
msgstr "Istraži →"

msgid "External"
msgstr "Vanjske"

msgid "Find 1D barcodes anywhere in the frame and decode their payloads."
msgstr ""
"Pronađite 1D barkodove bilo gdje u okviru i dekodirajte njihove korisne "
"poruke."

msgid "Find blobs of color"
msgstr "Pronađite nakupine boje"

msgid "Find your board"
msgstr "Pronađi svoju ploču"

msgid "Firmware, IDE, and example sources — issues and pull requests welcome."
msgstr ""
"Firmware, IDE i izvorni primjeri — problemi i zahtjevi za povučenjem su "
"dobrodošli."

