msgstr "Referenca jezika, sintaksa i semantika jezgre izvršavanja."

msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "Temeljne biblioteke"

msgid "License"
msgstr "Licencija"

msgid ""
"Live face detection, AprilTag tracking, QR scanning, and YOLO. All on-device"
" in pure MicroPython. No host computer, no cloud."
msgstr ""
"Živo prepoznavanje lica, praćenje AprilTag, skeniranje QR i YOLO. Sve na "
"uređaju u čistom MicroPython-u. Bez host računala, bez oblaka."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — pre-quantised, no"
" download needed."
msgstr ""
"Učitan iz <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — unaprijed "
"kvantiziran, nije potrebno preuzimanje."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — running "
"standalone here, without palm detection upstream."
msgstr ""
"Učitan iz <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — ovdje se izvodi"
" samostalno, bez detekcije dlana uzvodno."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — no SD card or download "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Učitan iz <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — nije potrebna SD kartica "
"ili preuzimanje."

msgid "Locate and identify AprilTags"
msgstr "Pronađite i identificirajte AprilTag oznake"

msgid "Low-level hardware: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC, and timers."
msgstr ""
"Hardver niske razine: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC i mjerači vremena."

msgid "Machine vision,<br>made simple."
msgstr "Strojni vid,<br>učinjen jednostavnim."

msgid "Machine vision: blobs, edges, lines, circles, features, and drawing."
msgstr "Strojni vid: nakupine, rubovi, linije, kružnice, značajke i crtanje."

msgid ""
"Made with <a href=\"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/\">Sphinx</a> using the <a "
