msgstr "Pregled"

msgid "Pass multiple thresholds for multi-color tracking in one call."
msgstr "Proslijedite više pragova za višebojno praćenje u jednom pozivu."

msgid ""
"Plug the OpenMV Cam into your computer via USB. A blue heartbeat LED blinks "
"when it's ready."
msgstr ""
"Priključite OpenMV Cam u računalo putem USB-a. Plava LED srčanog ritma "
"trepće kada je spreman."

msgid ""
"Powered by the <a href=\"https://github.com/mchehab/zbar\">ZBar</a> library "
"— recognises EAN, UPC, Code&nbsp;39/93/128, Codabar, ITF, ISBN, and DataBar."
msgstr ""
"Pogoni ga <a href=\"https://github.com/mchehab/zbar\">ZBar</a> biblioteka — "
"prepoznaje EAN, UPC, Code&nbsp;39/93/128, Codabar, ITF, ISBN i DataBar."

